 "remarks": "Welcome to 28 Old Norwalk Road, situated in the idyllic town of New Canaan,CT. This beautifully maintained home offers a fresh,sophisticated take on the classic New England farmhouse, blending timeless character with modern style & effortless functionality. Ideally located in the heart of New Canaan & just a short walk to town,train station & New Canaan's schools - combining exceptional indoor & outdoor living w/the convenience of a highly sought-after location.An open,spacious floor plan w/exceptional flexibility for today's lifestyle & inviting living spaces designed for both everyday living & effortless entertaining.The heart of the home is a breathtaking newly renovated kitchen,thoughtfully designed by an accomplished New York interior designer & is appointed with premier appliances,refined finishes & tasteful details throughout. Beautifully sited on more than an acre of landscaped,park-like grounds,the property features rolling lawns,mature plantings,abundant hydrangeas & private fenced backyard. The expansive outdoor living area includes a terrace w/fireplace & built-in grill - perfect for entertaining or enjoying quiet evenings at home Adding to the property's exceptional versatility is a pea gravel courtyard & detached 200 sq. ft. outdoor space fully heated & air conditioned for year-round comfort.This flexible space can be tailored to suit the renter's preference.Extraordinary details abound throughout,creating a home that is as welcoming as it is refined.",
